      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "catalog → PolicyGate.Evaluate() → eligible → TierSelector.Select()\n\nPolicy decides what is PERMISSIBLE.\nThe router then decides what is APPROPRIATE among the permissible.\n\nReverse these two and a cost optimisation can reach a model\ngovernance has not approved. The order is asserted by test, not\nleft to code reading.",
      "originalText": "catalog → PolicyGate.Evaluate() → eligible → TierSelector.Select()\n\nPolicy decides what is PERMISSIBLE.\nThe router then decides what is APPROPRIATE among the permissible.\n\nReverse these two and a cost optimisation can reach a model\ngovernance has not approved. The order is asserted by test, not\nleft to code reading.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
