      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pure, deterministic, caller-supplied signals only — never inferred from model output.\ntokens/32000 × 0.40  +  multiStep × 0.25  +  retrieval × 0.20  +  toolCalls × 0.15\nRounded to 4dp, clamped 0–1.   IndicatedTier:  <0.35 Economy · <0.70 Standard · else Premium.",
      "originalText": "Pure, deterministic, caller-supplied signals only — never inferred from model output.\ntokens/32000 × 0.40  +  multiStep × 0.25  +  retrieval × 0.20  +  toolCalls × 0.15\nRounded to 4dp, clamped 0–1.   IndicatedTier:  <0.35 Economy · <0.70 Standard · else Premium.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
