      "text": "Routed to the tier the complexity score indicated, within both the policy\nceiling and the request ceiling. Rationale names the deciding factor in a\nplain sentence, because the presenter reads it aloud on stage.",
      "originalText": "Routed to the tier the complexity score indicated, within both the policy\nceiling and the request ceiling. Rationale names the deciding factor in a\nplain sentence, because the presenter reads it aloud on stage.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
